# Publicly readable, no redistribution grant

This repository is published so that ArcheBase teams and their agents can load the
skill by repository and commit. Public visibility is not a redistribution grant:
the skill text, references and templates remain ArcheBase brand material, and the
upstream VI Guide dependency (https://github.com/archebase/archebase-vi-guide) is
proprietary and separately governed.

Rights notes:

- Reference files contain synthesized design-method guidance, not reproductions of
  source text. Third-party permissions were confirmed by the brand owner on
  2026-09-27; the record lives in the internal repository `archebase/archebase-design-workspace` (`sources/AUTHORIZATION.md`).
- Attribution to each design source is kept in the referencing file; per-source
  licence terms are recorded in that workspace's `sources/source-ledger.csv`.
- Rights for any material you add to a deliverable remain the publisher's
  responsibility.
